{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>ואתנה</b> Three times in the Masorah: ואתנה ידעתן · ואתנה צאני צאן מרעיתי · ואתנה גשם שוטף אבני אלגכיש תכלנה. Just as צאן מרעיתי below speaks of Israel, so too צאן stated here is expounded in the midrash regarding the exiles — גשם שוטף ואבני אלגביש — that he said to them: you know that there was a torrential rain and stones falling upon me while I was in the field with the sheep."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {0 "The third Masorah quotation reads אלגכיש in the first occurrence and אלגביש in the second; both are forms of the word for hailstones. The second occurrence also prefixes ו to אבני, absent in the first. Retained both forms as written."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:29.670008394Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}